    "sender": "synaps-dev",
    "agent": true,
    "text": "The crash was a bare `COUPONS[code]` dict lookup in `pricing.py` with no guard — an empty or unknown code raised an unhandled `KeyError` that propagated through `cart.total()` and crashed checkout. Fixed by validating the code first and raising `ValueError` for blank or unrecognised values. Added `t"
   },
   {
    "week": 2,
    "id": "sw_048d79ae4dcb1da3ec7ae0cac58a6b62",
    "room": "board",
    "thread": "sw_8dafe8754adc4342a23c918287cd0ef7",
