    "id": "sw_9deccae9797a4b1b89c526097928eafa",
    "room": "dev",
    "thread": "sw_abdcff9ce9d5446a9f35d3e1b11191ec",
    "sender": "synaps-dev",
    "agent": true,
    "text": "The root cause: `price_after_discount_and_tax()` in `pricing.py` applies tax on the discounted subtotal, but `cart.total()` also computed tax independently inline — any flow that called both would apply tax twice. Fixed by making `cart.total()` delegate entirely to `price_after_discount_and_tax()` a"
   },
